/*!
\page page_stfttrawhit StFttRawHit

\brief Raw digitised signal from a single FTT (Forward sTGC) strip channel.

\section fttrawhit_overview Overview

StFttRawHit stores the VMM ASIC output for one strip of the **Forward sTGC Tracker (FTT)**.
It holds both raw electronics coordinates (sector, RDO, FEB, VMM, channel) and the
mapped detector coordinates (plane, quadrant, row, strip, orientation) from the channel map.

**Detector**: Forward sTGC Tracker (FTT)  
**Stage**: Raw DAQ (VMM output) → channel mapping

\section fttrawhit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFttRawHit
\endcode

Stored in \c StFttCollection via \c StPtrVecFttRawHit.

\section fttrawhit_geometry FTT Geometry

| Term | Description |
|------|-------------|
| Plane | One of 4 sTGC detector planes |
| Quadrant | A (0), B (1), C (2), D (3) per plane |
| Row | Strip row within a quadrant |
| Strip | Individual strip within a row |
| Orientation | Horizontal(0), Vertical(1), DiagonalH(2), DiagonalV(3), Unknown(4) |

\section fttrawhit_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c UChar_t | \c mSector | Electronics sector |
| \c UChar_t | \c mRDO | RDO board number |
| \c UChar_t | \c mFEB | Front-End Board number |
| \c UChar_t | \c mVMM | VMM ASIC chip number |
| \c UChar_t | \c mChannel | VMM channel (0–63) |
| \c UShort_t | \c mADC | Raw pulse height |
| \c UShort_t | \c mBCID | Bunch-crossing ID |
| \c Short_t | \c mTB | Time bin relative to trigger |
| \c Short_t | \c mBCIDDelta | BCID delta from trigger |
| \c Short_t | \c mTime | Calibrated time (ns) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mPlane | Mapped plane (0–3) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mQuadrant | Mapped quadrant (0–3) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mRow | Mapped strip row |
| \c UChar_t | \c mStrip | Mapped strip index |
| \c UChar_t | \c mOrientation | Strip orientation code |
| \c UShort_t | \c mIdTruth | MC truth GEANT track ID |
| \c UShort_t | \c mQaTruth | MC truth quality (%) |

\section fttrawhit_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c plane(), \c quadrant(), \c row(), \c strip() | Mapped detector coordinates |
| \c orientation() | Strip orientation code |
| \c adc() | Raw ADC pulse height |
| \c time() | Calibrated hit time (ns) |
| \c bcid(), \c dbcid(), \c tb() | Timing information |
| \c setRaw(...) | Set electronics readout fields |
| \c setMapping(...) | Set mapped detector coordinate fields |

\section fttrawhit_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
for (const StFttRawHit* rh : fttColl->rawHits()) {
    UChar_t  plane = rh->plane();
    UChar_t  quad  = rh->quadrant();
    UShort_t adc   = rh->adc();
    Short_t  t     = rh->time(); // calibrated (ns)
}
\endcode

\see StFttCluster, StFttPoint, StFttCollection
*/
